{
  "description": "Retrieval-only ground truth for the chunking (Task 03) and retriever (Task 06) experiments. A retrieved chunk 'contains the answer' when it comes from one of accepted_sources and matches every regex in answer_patterns (case-insensitive). The first five questions are the five sample questions of the chunking experiment. Written before any tuning and not changed afterwards.",
